"The credentials file is a properties file with keys `realm`, `host`, `user`, "
"and `password`. For example:"
msgstr ""
"認証情報ファイルは `realm`、`host`、`user`、`password` をキーとするプロパティファ"
"イルである。例:"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-publish.md:142
msgid "The second way is to specify them inline:"
msgstr ""
"2つ目の方法はインラインで指定することである:"

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-publish.md:145
msgid "\"Sonatype Nexus Repository Manager\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-publish.md:145
msgid "\"my.artifact.repo.net\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-publish.md:145
msgid "\"admin\""
msgstr ""

#: src/reference/reference/sbt-publish.md:145
